{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>11月19日《萬千星輝賀台慶》的大型歌舞表演掀起全網熱話，當然唔可以錯過女神葉蒨文展現誘人舞姿，其逼爆上圍隨着節奏狂彈的畫面瞬間成為焦點，這段長達10秒的震撼片段在網上瘋傳！</p>\n<h2>女神葉蒨文性感熱舞 上圍逼爆成焦點</h2>\n<p>11月19日晚由陳煒、陳敏之、傅嘉莉及姚子羚領軍帶來大型歌舞表演「炫舞女王」，眾人換上極具誘惑色彩的服飾，在現場幻彩雷射燈光下大曬修長美腿。不過當葉蒨文登場時，網民視線瞬間被她脹卜卜的上圍吸引，差點蓋過其他女星風頭。有現場粉絲拍下直擊片段上載至網絡，畫面中可見她上圍隨着激烈舞蹈動作展現超強動感，視覺效果極具衝擊力，短短10秒的拋胸畫面實在吸引。</p>\n<h2>曾展望大讚女友打扮猶如雅典娜化身</h2>\n<p>面對網上瘋傳的熱舞片段，葉蒨文在紅地毯受訪時透露為應付這次高難度舞蹈演出，早已跳到腳傷甚至需要服用消炎藥頂硬上。男友曾展望對女友這身搶眼造型給予極高評價，大讚她十足希臘女神雅典娜一樣，讓女方聞言後立即風騷擺出誘人姿勢。對於外界聚焦在女友身材上，曾展望表現得毫不介意並表示「都預咗俾人睇，咁又唔會蝕嘅，公司生日嘛」，大方言論引起網民熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚：葉蒨文先最正</h2>\n<p>這段時長僅10秒的震撼熱舞直拍片段曝光後，隨即在各大社交平台上獲得超過1,000讚好，有網民直指她是全場焦點並表示「真系全晚最正」、「真的跳得很耀眼」、「葉蒨文先最正，身形真係正」，對其耀眼身形及舞蹈表現讚不絕口。同時也有不少人把焦點放在男方身上，除了認為女方身形越來越豐滿外，更紛紛留言指「曾男朋友幸福死了」，甚至有人打趣表示「Sophie越来越大，GM越来越瘦」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518965725763382_16824543856b006b99e926b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518965725763382_16824543856b006b99e926b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>葉蒨文登場時，網民視線瞬間被她脹卜卜的上圍吸引，差點蓋過其他女星風頭。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518965896934911_17931252726b006b9b696d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518965896934911_17931252726b006b9b696d7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有現場粉絲拍下直擊片段上載至網絡，畫面中可見她上圍隨着激烈舞蹈動作展現超強動感。（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951896598387162_14176105616b006b9c313ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"images (28).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951896598387162_14176105616b006b9c313ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾展望對女友這身搶眼造型給予極高評價，大讚她十足希臘女神雅典娜一樣！（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518966056990215_12867870536b006b9d08aa3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518966056990215_12867870536b006b9d08aa3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>視覺效果極具衝擊力，短短10秒的拋胸畫面實在吸引。（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951896617795214_11526190806b006b9e310ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951896617795214_11526190806b006b9e310ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有人打趣表示「Sophie越来越大，GM越来越瘦」。（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518966279456844_13683264436b006b9f53fe6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518966279456844_13683264436b006b9f53fe6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518966391896988_19138451106b006ba04ae24.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179518966391896988_19138451106b006ba04ae24.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:03:54.961985+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1124,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T15:47:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:57.788417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:27.487493+00:00","content_hash":"e213f6a0b8cecb106481b425da22dfba23803169f7e243741c4472b11723bc81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}